            <ArticleTitle>AuNPs/COFs as a new type of SERS substrate for sensitive recognition of polyaromatic hydrocarbons.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>11044-11047</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1039/c7cc06440c</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this work, Au nanoparticles self-assembled with covalent-organic frameworks via a 1 min process at room temperature, and the obtained nanocomposite was employed as a new type of surface-enhanced Raman scattering sensor for the recognition of polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons with high sensitivity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
